t": "The 14k's J5 lost 4.0 points (+2.3 to +6.2 for Black), against the engine's B4. It was the last real swing in the game, but the lead then drifted back to about +2 and stayed there to the end."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py parses a pasted board and prints each group's stones and liberties with a danger flag, and count.py flood-fills empty regions to tally area score with named dead stones removed; both only inspect the current position and never propose, rank or look ahead at moves.", "stop": false}}